  {
   "id": "neon-apex-beyond-the-limit-332863@major-2025-06-17",
   "gameId": "neon-apex-beyond-the-limit-332863",
   "displayName": "Update Notes for June 13",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-06-17T09:33:50.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We're excited to announce this latest update (v50613) includes...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) Following a number of requests, we have added Steam Achievements to Neon Apex, available now in the recent update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "2) This update also includes a slight adjustment to the AI behaviour which should reduce the chances of collisions with AI vehicles spinning the player off into the track barriers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3) We have also fixed a bug that causes particular cars to get caught on bumps on certain tracks causing them to come to a sudden stop.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As ever, let us know your thoughts, issues and suggestions for the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
